dling is insufficient, when the site is still being commissioned, when vendor integration is incomplete, or when regulatory or contractual restrictions limit who may issue commands. Full command capability requires an explicit operating agreement, validated command safety checks, and confirmation that local fallback behavior remains independent and safe if communication fails.",
